      "snippet": "I was here at 5 PM on Monday, November 2nd. The guys working couldn’t handle the fact that I pointed out my matcha latte wasn’t hot, even though I specifically asked for it extra hot. When they offered to remake it, I simply asked for it iced instead, since apparently what I’d been served was their version of “extra hot.”\n\nSomehow, that simple request seemed to stress them out even more. Easily the worst Blank Street I’ve ever been to. I was scared they poisoned my drink after that because of their exaggerated reactions to my normal request.\n\nI walked in excited and left really stressed out and feeling gaslit.",
      "extracted_snippet": {
        "original": "I was here at 5 PM on Monday, November 2nd. The guys working couldn’t handle the fact that I pointed out my matcha latte wasn’t hot, even though I specifically asked for it extra hot. When they offered to remake it, I simply asked for it iced instead, since apparently what I’d been served was their version of “extra hot.”\n\nSomehow, that simple request seemed to stress them out even more. Easily the worst Blank Street I’ve ever been to. I was scared they poisoned my drink after that because of their exaggerated reactions to my normal request.\n\nI walked in excited and left really stressed out and feeling gaslit."
      },
